.TH NN-REGRESSION 1 "2026" "nn 0.1.0" "NN Manual"
.SH NAME
nn-regression \- compare old vs new against validation vectors
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B nn regression [options] <old> <new> <tests>
.SH DESCRIPTION
Fail if accuracy, memory, latency, or file size grow beyond policy thresholds.
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
.B \-\-max\-accuracy\-loss VALUE
Fail if accuracy drops more than VALUE.
.TP
.B \-\-max\-memory\-growth VALUE
Fail if RAM grows more than this fraction.
.TP
.B \-\-max\-latency\-growth VALUE
Fail if latency grows more than this fraction.
.TP
.B \-\-max\-model\-growth VALUE
Fail if file size grows more than this fraction.
.SH EXIT STATUS
0 pass; 1 policy failure.
.SH EXAMPLES
.nf
nn regression old.onnx new.onnx tests/
.fi
.SH SEE ALSO
nn-compare(1), nn-validate(1)
